  "description": "天依蓝 · 洛天依主题皮肤：暗色夜空协奏、亮色云端城堡两套插画随主题切换，含侧栏半身像、舞台光与 #66CCFF 强调色。",
  "author": "HuTao71566",
  "license": "MIT",
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/HuTao71566/dsh-skin-tianyi-azure.git"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/HuTao71566/dsh-skin-tianyi-azure#readme",
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/HuTao71566/dsh-skin-tianyi-azure/issues"
  },
  "type": "module",
  "icon": "assets/icon.svg",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./index.js",
    "./client": "./client.js",
    "./skin.json": "./skin.json",
    "./locale/*.json": "./locale/*.json",
    "./icon": "./assets/icon.svg"
